What is asp.net core
-> It is a cross platform, high-performance, open source framework for building modern, cloud based, internet connected applications.
-> It is a redisign of asp.net 4.x

Core benefits and features
-> cross platform
-> one programming model for MVC and Web API
   (both the mvc controller class and the ASP.NET web api controllers class inherit from the same Controller base class and returns IActionResult)
   IActionResult ----> ViewResult
                   --> JsonResult
-> Dependency Injection
-> Testability
-> Open-Source
-> Modular (with middleware components)
   Both request and response pipelines are composed using the middleware components
   Rich set of built-in components are provided out of the box
   custom middleware components can also be created